WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.671
Step 1. Open the Immunizations tab of the encounter.

1.2
00:00:03.671 --> 00:00:08.604
You change the forecast status of a recommendation in the Schedule section,

1.3
00:00:08.604 --> 00:00:12.853
while the encounter where the policy was applied is open.

2.1
00:00:12.853 --> 00:00:15.434
Step 2. Find the recommendation.

2.2
00:00:15.434 --> 00:00:21.551
Each row shows the vaccine, a status badge, and its Earliest, Due and Overdue dates.

2.3
00:00:21.551 --> 00:00:26.712
This dose is Upcoming, because its earliest date is still ahead.

3.1
00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:31.295
Step 3. Open the Status menu. Select Status on the row.

3.2
00:00:31.295 --> 00:00:37.124
The Forecast status menu offers Due, Complete, Immune and Contraindicated,

3.3
00:00:37.124 --> 00:00:40.303
and marks Due for an Upcoming row.

4.1
00:00:40.303 --> 00:00:42.781
Step 4. Select the new status.

4.2
00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:47.905
Care saves as soon as you select it and shows Recommendation updated.

4.3
00:00:47.905 --> 00:00:53.010
The row shows its new badge and moves below the Upcoming rows.
